| FR-014 | .vtt and .srt cue numbers, timestamps, and cue settings are removed before processing; speaker names and 
spoken text are kept. | Must | AC-012 |
| FR-015 | Before processing, the user sees a notice naming the provider that will receive the transcript text. The 
