TRACK; if an extension is unavailable or rows exist, stop and replan — rows require an owner backfill decision 
implemented and tested locally before T14). Local migrations add AI settings (provider ∈ anthropic/openai/kimi/glm, 
model, reasoning level, daily limit 1–200 default 20, revision, updated by/at, key last four) readable by company 
