models, reasoning levels with their wire parameters, context/output budgets, and documented pre-processing rejection 
status/type/code combinations. An admin-only route (authorizes admin of that company, then calls the save RPC) saves 
settings (key write-only, response masked). The company page's admin "Settings" area gains an "AI" section. E2E specs 
