36: ## T1 — Meeting-note schema, read isolation, and lifecycle contract
37: Reasoning: Every other task needs notes that carry their own company and author, survive space deletion, and are 
readable only inside their company. Grounded in the observed schema gaps above (no 
company_id/author/revision/versions/participants; cascade from spaces; RLS joining through `spaces`, which breaks once 
`room_id` can be NULL).
38: Task: Local migrations make `meeting_notes` carry immutable `company_id` (→ companies ON DELETE CASCADE), author 
historical id + name snapshots and a live `created_by` (ON DELETE SET NULL), a revision, rich content (≤100,000 
chars), optional summary, transcript identity, and nullable `room_id` (ON DELETE SET NULL); add note participants 
(user id + name snapshot, ≤50) and immutable versions (title, meeting date, participants, content, summary, editor 
historical id + name snapshot, live editor reference ON DELETE SET NULL). RLS scopes every read of notes, 
participants, versions, and items to `users.company_id = note.company_id` via `supabase_uid = auth.uid()::text` (never 
through `spaces`). `authenticated` and `anon` hold no INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE on these tables. Historical and identity 
fields are immutable for every role (trigger or equivalent). Legacy-row handling: the migration refuses to run if 
`meeting_notes` has rows without a derivable company (SPEC §9 preflight).
39: Done when: The local database enforces the schema, read isolation, immutability, and deletion behavior above.
40: Verify by: `__tests__/meeting-notes-db/` integration tests for AC-020 (space delete keeps notes and authors; 
company delete removes them), AC-021 (former member loses read; user deletion keeps snapshots; rejoin restores read), 
AC-023 (cross-company reads of notes/versions/participants/items return nothing for member and admin; 
`company_id`/`created_by` unchangeable by any client), AC-031 (user deletion succeeds, snapshots unchanged), and 
direct-client INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE denial; `supabase-rls-reviewer` audit.
41: Covers: FR-028, FR-029, FR-030, BR-001, BR-007, AC-020, AC-021, AC-023, AC-031
42: Root: T1
